---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout lang="en" title="Privacy Policy — Pip24h" description="Pip24h's privacy policy.">
	<article class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
		<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p><em>Last updated: October 29, 2026</em></p>

		<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
		<p>
			Pip24h may collect information you provide directly (e.g. your email if you subscribe to our newsletter)
			and information collected automatically when you visit the site (e.g. IP address, browser type, pages
			viewed) through standard analytics tools.
		</p>

		<h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
		<p>
			Information is used to operate and improve the site, send our newsletter if you've subscribed, and measure
			content performance. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.
		</p>

		<h2>3. Cookies</h2>
		<p>
			The site may use cookies to remember your preferences and for analytics purposes. You can disable cookies
			in your browser, though some features may not work as intended.
		</p>

		<h2>4. Analytics</h2>
		<p>Traffic is measured with two tools, both operated for aggregate, statistical purposes only:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> — page views, referrers and Core Web Vitals. It does not set
				cookies, does not fingerprint visitors and does not track you across sites.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> — page views, approximate location, device and browser. It is only
				loaded after you accept analytics cookies; if you decline, your visits are measured with cookieless,
				aggregated pings only. You can also opt out with the
				<a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">
					Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a
				>.
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			Clicks on partner links are counted in aggregate so we can see which reviews are useful. That
			measurement records only the partner and the page the click came from.
		</p>
		<p>You can change your choice at any time with the “Cookie settings” link in the footer.</p>

		<h2>5. External Links</h2>
		<p>
			The site contains links to third-party brokers, including affiliate links (see our
			<a href="/en/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>). We are not responsible for the privacy
			practices or content of these third-party sites.
		</p>

		<h2>6. Contact</h2>
		<p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact us via the email address listed on the site.</p>
	</article>
</Layout>
